<title>POLAND: Polish KGHM sees 1997 net up to PLN 286 mln.</title>
<headline>Polish KGHM sees 1997 net up to PLN 286 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish copper concern KGHM Polska Miedz SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 286 million zlotys from last year's 147.2 million zlotys, the company said in its issue prospectus on Wednesday.</p>
<p>KGHM said its sales were likely to rise to 3.7 billion zlotys from 3.4 billion in 1997.</p>
<p>It said its group net was likely to rise to 310 million zlotys on 3.9 billion zloty sales in 1997 from last year's 148.9 million and 3.5 billion respectively.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
